{{ 'ts-showcase.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- comment -%}
  TS 商品橫排 —— 大卡橫向排列、滑出右邊緣，上面可以切「新品／熱銷」。

  跟「TS 商品陣列」（ts-lineup）的差別：那個是固定格線、有分類膠囊；
  這個是橫向軌道、卡片大得多（照 DJI 量的：卡片佔內容寬約 30%），
  而且用分頁切換而不是分類篩選。兩個都留著，看哪個好用。

  刻意不放價格——品牌站的價格進到商品頁才看得到。

  只新增 ts- 開頭的檔案，主題原有檔案一個都不動。
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  分頁清單：從各商品的「歸在哪一頁」長出來，順序照後台第一次出現的順序，
  所以 Mars 把哪個 block 拖到前面，哪個分頁就排前面。
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign tlist = '|' -%}
{%- for block in section.blocks -%}
  {%- assign t = block.settings.tab | strip -%}
  {%- if t != blank and t != 'both' -%}
    {%- assign probe = '|' | append: t | append: '|' -%}
    {%- unless tlist contains probe -%}
      {%- assign tlist = tlist | append: t | append: '|' -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign tabs = tlist | remove_first: '|' | split: '|' -%}
{%- assign show_tabs = false -%}
{%- if section.settings.show_tabs and tabs.size > 1 -%}{%- assign show_tabs = true -%}{%- endif -%}

<div class="ts-showcase"
     style="--tss-bg:{{ section.settings.bg }};
            --tss-ink:{{ section.settings.ink }};
            --tss-card-w:{{ section.settings.card_w }}px;
            --tss-radius:{{ section.settings.radius }}px;
            --tss-gap:{{ section.settings.gap }}px;
    --tss-art:{{ section.settings.art_ratio | default: "4 / 3" }};
    --tss-card-ratio:{{ section.settings.card_ratio | default: "3 / 4" }};
            --tss-hover:{{ section.settings.hover | times: 0.01 }};
            --tss-pad0:{{ section.settings.pad }}px;">

  <div class="ts-showcase__head">
    <div>
      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="ts-showcase__eb">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
        {%- comment -%}
        B1：首頁需要一個真的 H1。原本 H1 被主題拿去包 logo（等於只跟 Google 說
        「這是我們公司」），已改成 span；這裡讓首頁第一段的標題接手。
        其他頁面維持 h2，不會出現兩個 h1。
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if section.settings.is_page_h1 -%}
        <h1 class="ts-showcase__h">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h1>
      {%- else -%}
        <h2 class="ts-showcase__h">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if show_tabs -%}
        <div class="ts-showcase__tabs" role="group" aria-label="{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}">
          {%- for t in tabs -%}
            <button type="button" data-tab="{{ t | escape }}"
                    aria-pressed="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">{{ t }}</button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- if section.settings.more_label != blank -%}
      <a class="ts-showcase__more" href="{{ section.settings.more_url | default: '#' }}">
        {{ section.settings.more_label }}
      </a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  <div class="ts-showcase__rail">
    <div class="ts-showcase__track">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- assign p = block.settings.product -%}
        {%- assign name = block.settings.title | default: p.title -%}
        {%- assign url = p.url | default: '#' -%}
        {%- assign t = block.settings.tab | strip -%}

        {%- comment -%}
          DJI 式色塊模式的文字顏色：底色深就用白字、淺就用深字，自動算。
          做成自動的原因是底色是「跟著照片走」的——換一張照片就要換底色，
          再叫人回來改一次文字顏色一定會忘記，忘記的那次就是白字配白底。
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign cbg = block.settings.card_bg | default: '#f8f9fc' -%}
        {%- assign cbright = cbg | color_brightness -%}
        {%- if cbright > 150 -%}
          {%- assign cink = '#1d1d1f' -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- assign cink = '#ffffff' -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        <a class="ts-card{% if section.settings.full_bleed %} ts-card--full{% if section.settings.overlay == 'glass' %} ts-card--glass{% elsif section.settings.overlay == 'panel' %} ts-card--panel{% endif %}{% elsif block.settings.fit == 'cover' %} ts-card--cover{% endif %}" href="{{ url }}"
           data-tab="{% if t == 'both' or t == blank %}*{% else %}{{ t | escape }}{% endif %}"
           style="--tss-card-bg:{{ block.settings.card_bg }};--tss-card-ink:{{ cink }};--tss-fade:{{ block.settings.fade | default: 42 }}%;"
           {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>

          {%- comment -%}
            圖片是這個區塊唯一真的會影響載入速度的東西（CSS＋JS 加起來只有 3KB，
            但一張原始商品照可以到 280KB）。所以：
            ① srcset：手機的卡片只有 264px 寬，沒必要送 900px 過去，讓瀏覽器自己挑
            ② sizes 的數字就是 CSS 裡三個斷點的實際卡片寬度，不是猜的
            ③ loading="lazy"：第一屏看不到的不先載
            ④ width/height：先佔好位子，圖載進來時版面不會跳
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign img = block.settings.image -%}
          {%- unless img -%}{%- assign img = p.featured_image -%}{%- endunless -%}
          <span class="ts-card__art">
            {%- if img -%}
              <img src="{{ img | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                   srcset="{{ img | image_url: width: 300 }} 300w,
                           {{ img | image_url: width: 450 }} 450w,
                           {{ img | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w,
                           {{ img | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w"
                   sizes="(max-width:749px) 264px, (max-width:1100px) 340px, {{ section.settings.card_w }}px"
                   alt="{{ name | escape }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                   width="{{ img.width }}" height="{{ img.height }}">
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="ts-card__none">選一個商品，或上傳去背圖片</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </span>

          <span class="ts-card__b">
            <span class="ts-card__n">{{ name }}</span>
            {%- if block.settings.slogan != blank -%}
              <span class="ts-card__s">{{ block.settings.slogan }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="ts-card__f">
              {%- if section.settings.more_text != blank -%}
                <span class="ts-card__more">{{ section.settings.more_text }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
              <span class="ts-card__buy">{{ section.settings.buy_text }}</span>
            </span>
          </span>
        </a>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script src="{{ 'ts-showcase.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{%- comment -%}G1：把這一段的商品輸出成機器讀得懂的清單{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'gc-ld-products', sec: section, list_name: section.settings.heading %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "TS 商品橫排",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "ts-showcase-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "文字"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "小標",
      "default": "最新上架"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "標題",
      "default": "剛做好的，先給你看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "is_page_h1",
      "label": "這是本頁的主標題（H1）",
      "default": false,
      "info": "整個網站每一頁只能開一個。首頁開這個，Google 才知道這頁在講什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "more_label",
      "label": "右邊的連結文字",
      "default": "看全部"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "more_url",
      "label": "右邊的連結指到哪"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "分頁切換"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_tabs",
      "label": "顯示分頁切換",
      "default": true,
      "info": "分頁是從下面每個商品的「歸在哪一頁」長出來的。兩個以上不同的名稱才會顯示。"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "卡片上的按鈕"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "more_text",
      "label": "左邊的文字連結",
      "default": "瞭解更多"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "buy_text",
      "label": "右邊的按鈕",
      "default": "立即購買"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "外觀"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "full_bleed",
      "label": "照片鋪滿整張卡片",
      "default": false,
      "info": "打開＝照片鋪滿整張卡、文字壓在照片上（DJI 那種）；關閉＝照片在上、文字在下面的色塊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "overlay",
      "label": "文字要怎麼跟照片相處（鋪滿模式才有用）",
      "default": "panel",
      "info": "色塊＝照片在上、下面一塊實心色，文字坐在純色上（DJI 官網就是這個，字永遠清楚）。另外兩種都是把字壓在照片上，換照片就要重新賭一次看不看得清。",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "panel",
          "label": "照片在上＋實心色塊在下（DJI 式）"
        },
        {
          "value": "glass",
          "label": "白色霧面玻璃壓字"
        },
        {
          "value": "dark",
          "label": "黑色漸層壓字"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "card_ratio",
      "label": "卡片比例（鋪滿模式才有用）",
      "default": "3 / 4",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "1 / 1",
          "label": "正方 1:1"
        },
        {
          "value": "8 / 9",
          "label": "近方形 8:9"
        },
        {
          "value": "4 / 5",
          "label": "直式 4:5"
        },
        {
          "value": "3 / 4",
          "label": "直式 3:4（較長）"
        },
        {
          "value": "2 / 3",
          "label": "直式 2:3（最長）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "art_ratio",
      "label": "滿版圖片的比例",
      "default": "4 / 3",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "1 / 1",
          "label": "正方 1:1"
        },
        {
          "value": "4 / 3",
          "label": "橫式 4:3"
        },
        {
          "value": "3 / 2",
          "label": "橫式 3:2"
        },
        {
          "value": "16 / 9",
          "label": "寬幅 16:9"
        },
        {
          "value": "3 / 4",
          "label": "直式 3:4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "card_w",
      "label": "卡片寬度",
      "min": 260,
      "max": 620,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 420,
      "info": "DJI 的卡片約佔內容寬的 30%。太窄會變成小圖示，太寬一次看不到兩張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "gap",
      "label": "卡片間距",
      "min": 8,
      "max": 48,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 32
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "radius",
      "label": "卡片圓角",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 24
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "hover",
      "label": "滑過去整張放大",
      "min": 100,
      "max": 110,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 102,
      "info": "設 100% 就是不放大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "pad",
      "label": "段落上下留白",
      "min": 24,
      "max": 140,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 56,
      "info": "上下各留這麼多，所以兩段之間看到的白是它的兩倍。平板與手機會自己按比例縮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "bg",
      "label": "整段底色",
      "default": "#FFFFFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "ink",
      "label": "文字與按鈕顏色",
      "default": "#141416"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "product",
      "name": "商品",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "product",
          "id": "product",
          "label": "商品",
          "info": "選了之後整張卡片會連到那個商品頁。"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image",
          "label": "去背圖片",
          "info": "留空就用商品主圖。建議上傳去背 PNG／WebP，卡片才不會出現白方塊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "fit",
          "label": "圖片顯示方式",
          "default": "cover",
          "info": "情境照選「滿版填滿」；去背圖選「完整置中」（四周留白、不裁切）。",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "cover",
              "label": "滿版填滿（照片）"
            },
            {
              "value": "contain",
              "label": "完整置中（去背圖）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "title",
          "label": "顯示名稱",
          "info": "留空就用商品原本的名字。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "slogan",
          "label": "一句口號",
          "info": "例：只發電，不發火"
        },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "tab",
          "label": "歸在哪一頁",
          "default": "新品",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "新品",
              "label": "新品"
            },
            {
              "value": "熱銷",
              "label": "熱銷"
            },
            {
              "value": "both",
              "label": "兩頁都出現"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "color",
          "id": "card_bg",
          "label": "這張卡的底色",
          "default": "#F8F9FC"
        },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "fade",
          "label": "照片往下淡出的高度",
          "min": 16,
          "max": 50,
          "step": 2,
          "unit": "%",
          "default": 42,
          "info": "產品站得比較低的照片（例如放在地板上的東西）要調小，否則產品下緣會被洗掉。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "TS 商品橫排",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "product"
        },
        {
          "type": "product"
        },
        {
          "type": "product"
        },
        {
          "type": "product"
        },
        {
          "type": "product"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
